anny. It is hostile to civilization. It can only and will only   devolve from one domination to the next. </content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/7199095797839920941/comments/default/7978774614985095832'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/7199095797839920941/comments/default/7978774614985095832'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2017/01/dont-trigger-sheriff-snowflake-or-he.html?showComment=1486242965207#c7978774614985095832' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2017/01/dont-trigger-sheriff-snowflake-or-he.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-7199095797839920941' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/7199095797839920941' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1428271662"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="February 4, 2017 at 2:16 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-8267480071991349129</id><published>2017-02-02T09:41:58.423-07:00</published><updated>2017-02-02T09:41:58.423-07:00</updated><title type='text'>:-) OK !</title><content type='html'>:-) OK !</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/7199095797839920941/comments/default/8267480071991349129'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/7199095797839920941/comments/default/8267480071991349129'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2017/01/dont-trigger-sheriff-snowflake-or-he.html?showComment=1486053718423#c826