ry garb worn by   occupying armies   stationed among the vanquished  by marauding medieval warlords.  Much is made of American democracy. We tell ourselves ceaselessly we are a free people living in a free land. We are taught  the judiciary is freedom&amp;#39;s great watchdog serving to put   the rule of law above the rule of man.    Yet the  same  judiciary which emerged in medieval Europe as a centralized  operation of  looting    has survived unchanged in modern America where it has insinuated itself  toward the same tyrannical ends. Our problem is not at all the reform government but to the contrary  the abolition  of the judiciary, to scuttle the judiciary in favor of the free enterprise private dispute resolution services operating in competitive free markets where they  are forced to  face    the ceaseless vetting of the ever vigilant  consumer.  </content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/7199095797839920941/comments/default/8799933471011132641'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/7199095797839920941/comments/default/8799933471011132641'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2017/01/dont-trigger-sheriff-snowflake-or-he.html?showComment=1485667939502#c8799933471011132641' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2017/01/dont-trigger-sheriff-snowflake-or-he.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-7199095797839920941' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/7199095797839920941' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1428271662"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displ